29],{}," tu peux toujours :",[29,1092,1093,1096,1102],{},[32,1094,1095],{},"Choisir un thème dans la liste",[32,1097,1098,1099,1015],{},"Éditer les variables CSS en direct (",[258,1100,1101],{},"CSS personnalisé",[32,1103,1104],{},"Importer un fichier de thème dans le dossier Themes",{"title":128,"searchDepth":129,"depth":129,"links":1106},[1107,1108,1109,1110],{"id":998,"depth":129,"text":999},{"id":1032,"depth":129,"text":1033},{"id":1050,"depth":129,"text":1051},{"id":1083,"depth":129,"text":1084},"Concevoir couleurs, polices, boutons et onglets dans le Theme Creator.",{},5,"\u002Ftheme-editor",{"title":984,"description":1111},"theme-editor","wkR6rxJNnSmcJeJxDdslCOIyK7-9BblSMG_tJA6IwRY",{"id":1119,"title":1120,"body":1121,"description":1258,"extension":136,"meta":1259,"navigation":138,"order":1260,"path":1261,"seo":1262,"stem":1263,"__hash__":1264},"content_fr\u002Frecording-editor.md","Éditeur d’enregistrement",{"type":7,"value":1122,"toc":1252},[1123,1126,1132,1136,1142,1162,1165,1169,1194,1198,1212,1216,1231,1242],[10,1124,1120],{"id":1125},"éditeur-denregistrement",[14,1127,1128,1129,1131],{},"Enregistre un clip dans SoundNinja, coupe-le, puis importe-le sur un onglet. Ouvre l’éditeur avec le bouton ",[258,1130,513],{}," dans la barre du lecteur.",[24,1133,1135],{"id":1134},"choisir-une-entrée","Choisir une entrée",[14,1137,1087,1138,1141],{},[258,1139,1140],{},"Paramètres → Audio"," :",[29,1143,1144,1150,1156],{},[32,1145,1146,1149],{},[258,1147,1148],{},"Périphériques d’entrée"," — microphone",[32,1151,1152,1155],{},[258,1153,1154],{},"Périphériques de sortie (audio PC)"," — loopback de ce que le PC joue",[32,1157,1158,1161],{},[258,1159,1160],{},"Volume d’entrée"," — gain de capture de 0 % à 200 %",[14,1163,1164],{},"Le bouton Enregistrer utilise le périphérique choisi ici.",[24,1166,1168],{"id":1167},"éditer-la-prise","Éditer la prise",[29,1170,1171,1174,1177,1185,1188,1191],{},[32,1172,1173],{},"Enregistrer et arrêter",[32,1175,1176],{},"Surveiller le vu-mètre d’entrée",[32,1178,1179,261,1182],{},[258,1180,1181],{},"Normaliser",[258,1183,1184],{},"Réduction de bruit",[32,1186,1187],{},"Couper tout le clip, couper à une sélection, ou supprimer une sélection",[32,1189,1190],{},"Annuler \u002F rétablir",[32,1192,1193],{},"Zoomer et dézoomer",[24,1195,1197],{"id":1196},"préparer-et-importer","Préparer et importer",[107,1199,1200,1203,1206],{},[32,1201,1202],{},"Ajoute la sélection ou la piste complète à la liste de staging.",[32,1204,1205],{},"La liste commence vide : enregistre, édite, puis ajoute un clip.",[32,1207,1208,261,1210,521],{},[258,1209,517],{},[258,1211,520],{},[24,1213,1215],{"id":1214},"séparation-de-stems-optionnel","Séparation de stems (optionnel)",[14,1217,1218,1219,1222,1223,1226,1227,1230],{},"Les builds officiels Windows, macOS et Linux livrent la fonction ",[258,1220,1221],{},"stems",". Le Record Editor peut garder les ",[258,1224,1225],{},"voix"," ou la ",[258,1228,1229],{},"musique"," avec BS-RoFormer.",[14,1232,1233,1234,1237,1238,1241],{},"Le modèle fait environ 158 MB et n’est ",[258,1235,1236],{},"pas"," inclus dans l’installateur. Télécharge-le depuis ",[258,1239,1240],{},"Paramètres → Séparation de stems",", ou accepte l’invite au premier lancement. L’installateur Windows peut aussi proposer de télécharger le modèle au premier démarrage.",[14,1243,1244,1245,1011,1248,1251],{},"Les builds source custom ont besoin d’un flag extra (",[321,1246,1247],{},"tauri:serve:stems",[321,1249,1250],{},"tauri:build:stems",").",{"title":128,"searchDepth":129,"depth":129,"links":1253},[1254,1255,1256,1257],{"id":1134,"depth":129,"text":1135},{"id":1167,"depth":129,"text":1168},{"id":1196,"depth":129,"text":1197},{"id":1214,"depth":129,"text":1215},"Capturer le micro ou l’audio du PC, éditer le clip et le poser sur ton board.",{},6,"\u002Frecording-editor",{"title":1120,"description":1258},"recording-editor","ZMpimB13mAmCTr4lHYb896wJ8oA5QijFuonM7e0rJU8",{"id":1266,"title":1267,"body":1268,"description":1480,"extension":136,"meta":1481,"navigation":138,"order":1482,"path":1483,"seo":1484,"stem":1485,"__hash__":1486},"content_fr\u002Fremote-control.md","Contrôle à distance",{"type":7,"value":1269,"toc":1473},[1270,1273,1276,1280,1309,1312,1315,1350,1354,1374,1377,1381,1413,1417,1423],[10,1271,1267],{"id":1272},"contrôle-à-distance",[14,1274,1275],{},"SoundNinja peut écouter sur ton réseau local pour que Bitfocus Companion (ou n’importe quel client HTTP\u002FWebSocket) joue et arrête des sons.",[24,1277,1279],{"id":1278},"activer-le-serveur-distant","Activer le serveur distant",[107,1281,1282,1287,1293,1299],{},[32,1283,449,1284,414],{},[258,1285,1286],{},"Paramètres → Distant",[32,1288,1289,1290,414],{},"Active le serveur distant. Le port par défaut est ",[258,1291,1292],{},"7331",[32,1294,1295,1296,414],{},"Optionnel : définis un token. Les clients doivent l’envoyer comme Bearer token ou ",[321,1297,1298],{},"?token=",[32,1300,1301,1302,1305,1306,414],{},"Copie l’URL ",[321,1303,1304],{},"http:\u002F\u002FIP:PORT",", ou copie l’IP système depuis ",[258,1307,1308],{},"Paramètres → À propos",[14,1310,1311],{},"Windows peut afficher une invite pare-feu la première fois que le serveur démarre. Autorise l’accès au réseau privé.",[24,1313,81],{"id":1314},"bitfocus-companion",[107,1316,1317,1324,1333,1343],{},[32,1318,1319,1320,414],{},"Installe ",[78,1321,81],{"href":1322,"rel":1323},"https:\u002F\u002Fbitfocus.io\u002Fcompanion",[99],[32,1325,1326,1327,1332],{},"Télécharge ",[78,1328,1331],{"href":1329,"rel":1330},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002Fcompanion-module-soundninja\u002Freleases\u002Flatest",[99],"SoundNinja-Companion.tgz",". Il n’y a pas encore de paquet Companion Store.",[32,1334,1335,1336,1339,1340,414],{},"Dans Companion : ",[258,1337,1338],{},"Modules → Load module package"," et choisis le ",[321,1341,1342],{},".tgz",[32,1344,1345,1346,1349],{},"Ajoute une connexion ",[258,1347,1348],{},"Sound Ninja",". Colle l’IP du PC, le port, et le token si tu en as défini un.",[24,1351,1353],{"id":1352},"actions","Actions",[29,1355,1356,1362,1368],{},[32,1357,1358,1361],{},[258,1359,1360],{},"Trigger Sound"," — choisis dans le menu déroulant live, ou tape un ID de son de 8 caractères (les variables Companion marchent)",[32,1363,1364,1367],{},[258,1365,1366],{},"Stop Sound"," — arrête un son en lecture par ID",[32,1369,1370,1373],{},[258,1371,1372],{},"Stop All"," — arrête tous les sons en lecture",[14,1375,1376],{},"Copie un ID de son dans SoundNinja depuis le menu contextuel du bouton ou la puce d’ID de la sélection multiple.",[24,1378,1380],{"id":1379},"feedbacks-et-variables","Feedbacks et variables",[29,1382,1383,1389,1401,1407],{},[32,1384,1385,1388],{},[258,1386,1387],{},"Sound Playing"," — vrai tant que cet ID de son est actif (utilise-le pour la couleur du bouton)",[32,1390,1391,1394,1395,1011,1398],{},[321,1392,1393],{},"$(soundninja:connected)"," — ",[321,1396,1397],{},"true",[321,1399,1400],{},"false",[32,1402,1403,1406],{},[321,1404,1405],{},"$(soundninja:playing_count)"," — combien de sons jouent",[32,1408,1409,1412],{},[321,1410,1411],{},"$(soundninja:last_triggered)"," — dernier ID de son déclenché",[24,1414,1416],{"id":1415},"api-http-avancé","API HTTP (avancé)",[14,1418,1419,1420],{},"Chemin de base : ",[321,1421,1422],{},"\u002Fapi\u002Fv1",[29,1424,1425,1431,1437,1443,1453,1459,1467],{},[32,1426,1427,1430],{},[321,1428,1429],{},"GET \u002Finfo"," — nom de l’app, version, protocole, si un token est requis",[32,1432,1433,1436],{},[321,1434,1435],{},"GET \u002Fsounds"," — liste des sons (id, name, tabs, active)",[32,1438,1439,1442],{},[321,1440,1441],{},"GET \u002Fstate"," — sons plus IDs actuellement en lecture",[32,1444,1445,1448,1449,1452],{},[321,1446,1447],{},"POST \u002Ftrigger"," avec ",[321,1450,1451],{},"{ \"id\" }"," — jouer un son",[32,1454,1455,1458],{},[321,1456,1457],{},"GET \u002Ftrigger\u002F:id"," — jouer (facile à tester dans un navigateur)",[32,1460,1461,1448,1464,1466],{},[321,1462,1463],{},"POST \u002Fstop",[321,1465,1451],{}," optionnel — arrêter un son ou tous",[32,1468,1469,1472],{},[321,1470,1471],{},"GET \u002Fws"," — état en direct ; envoyer des commandes trigger\u002Fstop en entrée",{"title":128,"searchDepth":129,"depth":129,"links":1474},[1475,1476,1477,1478,1479],{"id":1278,"depth":129,"text":1279},{"id":1314,"depth":129,"text":81},{"id":1352,"depth":129,"text":1353},{"id":1379,"depth":129,"text":1380},{"id":1415,"depth":129,"text":1416},"Déclencher SoundNinja depuis Bitfocus Companion sur le réseau local.",{},7,"\u002Fremote-control",{"title":1267,"description":1480},"remote-control","K_OaPi35SE1UyZR55pVcFsepHwNI1gVItIGw8Wc63e8",{"id":1488,"title":1489,"body":1490,"description":1578,"extension":136,"meta":1579,"navigation":138,"order":1580,"path":1581,"seo":1582,"stem":1494,"__hash__":1583},"content_fr\u002Fsupport.md","Support",{"type":7,"value":1491,"toc":1571},[1492,1495,1498,1502,1505,1512,1520,1524,1531,1533,1546,1550,1561,1565],[10,1493,1489],{"id":1494},"support",[14,1496,1497],{},"SoundNinja est un projet communautaire en bêta précoce. Le plus rapide pour obtenir de l’aide, c’est GitHub.",[24,1499,1501],{"id":1500},"signaler-un-bug-ou-poser-une-question","Signaler un bug ou poser une question",[14,1503,1504],{},"Ouvre une issue sur GitHub :",[14,1506,1507],{},[78,1508,1511],{"href":1509,"rel":1510},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Fissues",[99],"github.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Fissues",[14,1513,1514,1515,261,1517,1519],{},"Indique ton OS, la version de SoundNinja (",[258,1516,348],{},[258,1518,1308],{},"), et les étapes pour reproduire.",[24,1521,1523],{"id":1522},"e-mail","E-mail",[14,1525,1526,1527],{},"Contact du mainteneur : ",[78,1528,1530],{"href":1529},"mailto:contact@marcus-universe.de","contact@marcus-universe.de",[24,1532,342],{"id":341},[14,1534,1535,1536,1538,1539,1541,1542,414],{},"Dans l’app, utilise ",[258,1537,348],{},". Les nouveaux builds app